Third-party notices

This plugin is an adapter for DeepSeek Harness and follows the adapter
interface and conventions of the following MIT-licensed upstream packages:

  @deepseek-ai/dsh-llm            Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek   (MIT)
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-llm-deepseek   Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek   (MIT)
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-credentials    Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek   (MIT)

Portions of the adapter implementation (error classification, stream chunk
shaping, retry policy wiring) were written with reference to
@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm-deepseek, which is distributed under the MIT License.
No source code from those packages is vendored into this repository.
